    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6">

                <pb facs="0053" n="6" xml:id="pg6"/>

                <head>6. Telegram 238 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d6-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-08-01">August 1, 1955, 8
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d6-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d6-1"/>
                <p>238. For Assistant Secretary McCardle From Gowen. Your 310.</p>
                <p>Garnish has been made available to Johnson. Garnish reported here only today.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
